{"meta":{"id":"null-handling","category":"it/syntax/java/types","title":"null 처리 (Optional) · Java","subtitle":"(JAVA)","summary":"NullPointerException, Objects.requireNonNullElse, Optional map · orElse","tags":["java","f-null"],"color":"orange","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-orange","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-orange-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-orange-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-orange-50 text-orange-700 border border-orange-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></span>JAVA</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">null 처리 (Optional) · Java</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-orange-50/70 border border-orange-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-orange-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> NullPointerException, Objects.requireNonNullElse, Optional map · orElse</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">null 과 NullPointerException</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">String name = null;\r\nname.length();          // NullPointerException (실행 시점)\r\n\r\nif (name != null &amp;&amp; !name.isEmpty()) { }\r\nString v = Objects.requireNonNullElse(name, &quot;이름 없음&quot;);   // ?? 와 같은 역할</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">Optional</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">Optional&lt;User&gt; user = repo.findById(1L);\r\n\r\nString city = user\r\n    .map(User::getAddress)        // ?. 체이닝과 비슷\r\n    .map(Address::getCity)\r\n    .orElse(&quot;없음&quot;);              // ?? 기본값\r\n\r\nuser.ifPresent(u -&gt; log.info(u.getName()));\r\nUser u = user.orElseThrow();      // 없으면 예외</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">반환값이 없을 수 있음을 타입으로 드러낸다. 필드 · 매개변수보다 <strong>반환 타입</strong>에 사용</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> TypeScript › null 처리 (?. · ??)</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/java/types/null-handling","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"java","title":"JAVA","path":"it/syntax/java"},{"id":"types","title":"기본 타입","path":"it/syntax/java/types"}],"hasImage":false}